## Summary

Project audit after ~6 weeks of no doc updates on master. The `.last-agent` and `STATUS.md`
on master were stale (last updated 2026-08-29), but significant work happened on three
feature branches during that time:

- **`claude/amazing-yalow-a5930c`** (7 commits, +969/−1063) — Security fix: removes all
  `shell=True` execution, converts to argv lists. Fixes a real command injection
  vulnerability where searching `firefox; touch <path>` in the GUI created the file.
  822 Python tests pass. NOT merged, NOT GUI-verified. PR being created 2026-10-07.
- **`feat/cross-source-search-normalization`** (10 commits, +612/−281) — Fixes cross-source
  search name normalization ("google chrome" returned only Flatpak, not AUR+Flatpak).
  PR #7 open, CI green. 811 Python tests pass. NOT merged, NOT GUI-verified.
- **`fix/upgrade-removal-safety`** (8 commits, +651/−1010) — Bootloader/kernel protection
  during upgrades (Atlas removed the running kernel on CachyOS). Phase 1 done, Phase 2
  NOT done. 799 Python tests pass. NOT merged, NOT GUI-verified.

Master itself has 2 unpushed docs commits (search normalization planning).

**Verification:** 787 Python tests + 62 JS contract tests green on master. CI green.

